===== Hardware =====
==== Serial ====

You can use your usual serial levelshifter. Pinout is:

<code>
[USB ports] [UEXT] [UEXT]

		 GND TX 
		[ o  o  o  o  o ]
		[ o  o  o  o  o ]
		    RX

	[WIFI card]

</code>


